 "title": "Intel replaces Fellow and Senior Fellow titles with Distinguished Engineer and Senior Distinguished Engineer",
 "summary": "Intel is retiring the 'Fellow' and 'Senior Fellow' titles that had been awarded to its top scientists and engineers for nearly half a century. The company will instead use 'Distinguished Engineer' and 'Senior Distinguished Engineer' titles, positioning the change as the creation of a new standard for technical leadership rather than a simple rename.",
